  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Drain sweetcorn. Drain and rinse black beans.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook soffritto mix until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• SPICY! You may find the spice blend hot! Add less if sensitive to heat. Add garlic paste and Mexican Fiesta spice blend, stirring, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add beans, baby spinach leaves, the water, the brown sugar and the plant-based butter and cook, stirring until thickened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Remove from heat. Stir through half the enchilada sauce, until combined.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6784770ef2efe8ce60991657-070810f2.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Lay mini flour tortillas on a chopping board. Spoon filling down the centre.\n• Roll tortilla up tightly and place, seam-side down, evenly spaced on the lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese.\n• Bake until golden and starting to crisp, 8-10 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6784770ef2efe8ce60991657-f9c5a1f4.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, wipe out pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook corn kernels until lightly browned, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a small bowl. Toss to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6784770ef2efe8ce60991657-d588d78b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide black bean loaded taquitos between plates.\n• Top with remaining enchilada sauce and corn salsa.\n• Drizzle over plant-based aioli to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6784770ef2efe8ce60991657-c2e14944.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
